{
  "title": "[POC] MAC Flapping Lab - Full Observability",
  "description": "Live lab monitoring: Ubuntu, SW1 SNMP interfaces, four container states, and independent C-to-A forwarding. Custom Docker CPU/memory/PIDs were not reporting at deployment; empty charts are a collection gap, not healthy state. No automatic remediation.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "Coverage: Ubuntu VM, SW1 + Host A/B/C containers, switch interfaces/SNMP and independent Câ†’A forwarding. e1/2 admin-disabled is expected during containment. No automatic remediation; review source freshness and recovery evidence.\n\nDeployment: SNMP and container state/probe sources verified 2026-11-06. Custom container CPU/memory/PIDs currently have no samples; inspect lab_observability resource collection. Disk chart excludes read-only loop and tmpfs mounts. Existing global Ubuntu memory monitor 340591132 is reused; the other new health monitors await UI publication."
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Ubuntu CPU idle (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:system.cpu.idle{host:network-aiops-lab}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Ubuntu memory usable (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:system.mem.pct_usable{host:network-aiops-lab} * 100",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Ubuntu disk usage (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:system.disk.in_use{host:network-aiops-lab,!device:/dev/loop*,!device:tmpfs} by {device} * 100",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Ubuntu uptime (seconds)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:system.uptime{host:network-aiops-lab}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Ubuntu network traffic",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:system.net.bytes_rcvd{host:network-aiops-lab} by {device}",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:system.net.bytes_sent{host:network-aiops-lab} by {device}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Expected container running state (1=running)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:network_aiops.lab.container.up{env:network-aiops,lab_id:macflap-v2} by {lab_container}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Container CPU (% of one core)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:network_aiops.lab.container.cpu_pct{env:network-aiops,lab_id:macflap-v2} by {lab_container}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Container memory (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:network_aiops.lab.container.memory_pct{env:network-aiops,lab_id:macflap-v2} by {lab_container}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Container used memory (bytes)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:network_aiops.lab.container.memory_used_bytes{env:network-aiops,lab_id:macflap-v2} by {lab_container}",
